#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generated single-file runtime for the active Football C + C2 /xi path.

This portable bundle intentionally excludes retired C3/C4 execution and the
legacy decision-triplet runner. Historical C3/C4 source may remain elsewhere
in the repository for audit history, but new Step-2 execution is C+C2 only.
"""

